  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 16,
      "learn": [
        "With a patient, use the <b>Sie</b>-imperative: infinitive + Sie. <b>Atmen Sie</b> ruhig.",
        "<b>du</b>: stem, often without -e. <b>Trink</b> Wasser. Irregular: <b>Nimm</b> die Tablette.",
        "<b>ihr</b>: the ihr-form without the pronoun, or with it. <b>Trinkt</b> Wasser.",
        "Please is <b>bitte</b>. A separable prefix still goes to the end: Atmen Sie tief <b>ein</b>."
      ],
      "vocab": [
        {
          "de": "Wasser",
          "article": "das",
          "en": "water",
          "emoji": "💧",
          "glossaryKey": "wasser"
